    {
      "tag": "H1",
      "text": "We believe every homeowner deserves a kitchen that feels like home - personal, functional, and beautiful, without the stress or second-guessing. As part of the MasterBrand family — the largest cabinet manufacturer in North America — we’ve learned a thing or two about what makes a great remodel experience. Now, we’ve transformed that expertise into a suite of digital tools that make remodeling simple, empowering, and accessible to everyone. With smart technology and a team of experts, we help you turn inspiration into action, with confidence and support every step of the way."
    },
